  <section class="about-content">
    <p><strong>I value long-term accumulation.</strong> This site is deliberately small: it keeps the work that was lived, considered, and may matter again later.</p>
    <p>The early archive is mostly Chinese technical notes on Linux, Java, Git, Docker, and Kubernetes. New English writing will be added thoughtfully instead of translated in bulk.</p>
    <p>You can find me on <a href="https://github.com/Vicebery" rel="me">GitHub</a>.</p>
